      "SentinelOne's agent makes detection and, in Protect mode, response decisions locally on the device using Static AI, Behavioral AI, and Deep Visibility telemetry: a connectivity gap is not automatically a protection gap, but Detect mode versus Protect mode is a real tradeoff worth checking per host.",
      "Storyline automatically tags every causally related event with a shared StorylineID, turning what would be dozens of disconnected alerts into one readable attack narrative. Read it from the root event forward, and still verify the specific step your response decision hinges on.",
